{"t": 1793554601.36, "type": "change", "tag": "attempt-1", "diff": "diff --git a/arm/brain.toml b/arm/brain.toml\nindex d7b4291..7ad54d6 100644\n--- a/arm/brain.toml\n+++ b/arm/brain.toml\n@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@\n [planner]\n-clearance = 0.0\n+clearance = 0.08\n \n [pd]\n kp = 100.0\n", "files": ["arm/brain.toml"], "stat": "1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)", "summary": "Gata, am pus `clearance = 0.08` in [brain.toml](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/brain.toml:2).\n\nInainte, cu 0.0, liftul era blocat la 0.22 m si bratul traversa orizontal direct in bloc, convins ca asta e viata.\n\nSocoteala ta, din fisiere, nu din simulator:\n- blocul are varful la 0.20 + 0.06 = 0.26 m ([scene.xml](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/scene.xml:14))\n- start si tinta sunt la 0.22 m ([brain.py](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/brain.py:10), [scene.xml](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/scene.xml:15)), iar liftul e `max(z0,z1) + clearance` ([brain.py](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/brain.py:33))\n- punctul cel mai jos vizibil e cutia albastra a sculei, cu fundul la lift \u2212 0.032 m ([scene.xml](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/scene.xml:31)), iar sfera de contact e la lift \u2212 0.023 m\n- cu 0.08, liftul e 0.30 m, deci fundul vizual e la 0.268 m (8 mm peste bloc), iar sfera e la 0.277 m (17 mm peste bloc)\n- limita de atingere pe tinta incidenta e lift 0.52 m, deci 0.30 m ramane confortabil in spatiul de lucru\n\nRestul fisierului e neatins, gains si timing neschimbate.", "problems": [], "seconds": 107.8, "tool_calls": 13, "sandbox": "available"}
